:: Robin's Lemonade Pay
<<location "beach">><<effects>>
<<endevent>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"I-I'll pay," you say, stepping in front of Robin.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
