<</if>>
Robin shakes <<his>> head and opens <<his>> mouth, but no words come out. You move in front of <<him>> and hand your money to the police.
<br><br>
As soon as they leave, Robin starts crying and presses <<his>> face against your shoulder. "I-I," <<he>> sobs. "I was so scared. Thank you." You keep holding <<him>> until <<his>> breathing slows, then <<he>> puts the money back beneath the stand.<<npcincr Robin trauma -3>><<lrtrauma>>
