:: Robin's Lemonade Offer
<<location "beach">><<effects>>
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>
<<speechresolve>>

You move in front of Robin and face the police.
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	You look away briefly before facing them again. "M-maybe you'd rather have sex with me instead of taking the money?" you ask.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"Would you rather... have sex with me instead of taking the money?" you ask.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"If you want me instead of the money, I can go with you," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Perhaps I can pay another way," you say. "Would you rather have sex with me instead of taking the money?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Forget the money," you say. "Have sex with me instead."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Why waste time on the money?" you ask. "Fuck me instead."
<<else>>
	"Wouldn't you rather have sex with me instead?" you ask.
<</if>>
The <<person1>><<person>> smiles. "Sure," <<he>> says. "That'd work."
<br><br>

Robin looks at you, confused. You do not tell <<nnpc_him "Robin">> exactly what you offered the police.
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"I-I'm going with them for a little while," you tell <<nnpc_him "Robin">>. "I'll come back."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"I'm going with them for a little while," you say. "I'll be back soon."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"It's okay. I'll go with them, then I'll come back," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I'm going with them to deal with the fine," you say. "I'll come back when it's done."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I'm going with them," you say. "I'll be back."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I'm getting rid of them," you say. "Stay here. I'll be back."
<<else>>
	"I'm going to work this out with them," you say. "I'll be back later."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if _robin.dom gte 40>>
	Robin hugs you tightly. "Be careful. I don't like the way those guys are looking at you."
<<else>>
	로빈이 당신을 껴안는다. "알았어. 곧 봐."
<</if>>
<br><br>
You leave the beach with the police. Their car is parked in a nearby alley. "Get in," the <<person2>><<person>> says. You climb into the back seat. <<He>> gets in beside you, while the <<person1>><<person>> enters through the other rear door.
